{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52983","headline":"登姑苏台赋附歌 · 任公叔","name":"登姑苏台赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中心不必兮子胥何爲？\n怀直道而骤谏，遭重昏之见危。\n将渔父以抗迹，且垂钓於江湄。\n（见《文苑英华》卷五二《登姑苏台赋》附）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"任公叔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52983.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52983","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}